## Key Rules

- Use `<b>bold</b>` tags within reportlab Paragraph text for inline bold
- Use `&amp;` for ampersands in text (reportlab uses XML parsing)
- Use unicode for special chars: `\u2014` (em dash), `\u2019` (right quote), `\u201c`/`\u201d` (smart quotes), `\u2194` (arrows)
- Signature lines: use fill lines (`"_" * 55`) for fields the client fills in (name, title, date, address if unknown)
- nBrain signature block always includes: "5962 La Place Court, Suite 265, Carlsbad, CA 92008" and "Cary Johnson, Co-Founder"
- Always use `PageBreak()` between SOW, MSA, and Signature pages
- After generating, read the PDF back to verify content rendered correctly
- Commit the PDF and the generator script, then push to deploy

## Liability Cap Formula

- Standard Cap: total fees paid (e.g., $31,000)
- Elevated Cap: 2x fees paid (e.g., $62,000)
- No Cap: willful misconduct, confidentiality breach, credential misuse
